# Chain stage 3: the Discovery for the only accepted Request.
id: chain-discovery
skill: highway-discovery
fixture: request
chain: 3
web: yes
open: /highway-discovery
ask: Which would you like to work on?
say: [select] 1
ask: Which option would you like to explore, or would you like to see a comparison matrix?
say: [decline] Not now.
writes: discoveries/**
expect: template discoveries/discoveries.md :: discovery-catalog.md
expect: template discoveries/DISC*.md :: discovery-record.md
